  <name>Task Coach</name>
  <name xml:lang="fr">Task Coach</name>
  <summary>Your friendly task manager</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="fr">Votre gestionnaire de taches convivial</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Task Coach is an open source todo manager to manage personal tasks and todo lists. It supports composite tasks, i.e. tasks within tasks. In addition, Task Coach allows you to categorize your tasks, track efforts against a budget per task, and much more.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Composite tasks with unlimited nesting</li>
      <li>Categories and tags for organization</li>
      <li>Effort tracking with budgets</li>
      <li>Reminders and recurring tasks</li>
      <li>Notes and attachments</li>
      <li>Multiple views: tree, list, calendar</li>
    </ul>
    <p xml:lang="fr">Task Coach est un gestionnaire de taches libre pour gerer vos taches et listes de choses a faire. Il supporte les taches composites. De plus, Task Coach vous permet de categoriser vos taches, suivre le temps passe par rapport a un budget associe a chaque tache, et bien plus.</p>
  </description>
